exports[`templates > confirm-account-deletion (en-US) matches the snapshot 1`] = `
{
  "html": "<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en-US" dir="ltr">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<meta name="color-scheme" content="light">
<title>Confirm closing your open-auri account</title>
</head>
<body style="margin:0;padding:24px 16px;background-color:#ffffff;color:#1a1a1a;font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5">
<div role="article" aria-label="Confirm closing your open-auri account" lang="en-US" style="max-width:560px;margin:0 auto">
<h1 style="font-size:22px;line-height:1.3;margin:0 0 16px;color:#1a1a1a">Confirm account closure</h1>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px">Hi Ana,</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px">We received a request to close your open-auri account. Once you confirm, the account is closed and the personal data linked to it is deleted as described in the privacy policy. This cannot be undone.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px"><a href="https://open-auri.example/conta/encerrar/confirmar?token=tok_delete" style="color:#0b57d0;text-decoration:underline;font-weight:600;font-size:18px">Close my account</a></p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px">If the link above does not open, copy this address into your browser:</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:14px;word-break:break-all"><a href="https://open-auri.example/conta/encerrar/confirmar?token=tok_delete" style="color:#0b57d0;text-decoration:underline">https://open-auri.example/conta/encerrar/confirmar?token=tok_delete</a></p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px">This link expires in 1 hour.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px">If you did not request this, ignore this message and consider changing your password. Your account stays active.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px">Details in the privacy policy: <a href="https://open-auri.example/privacidade" style="color:#0b57d0;text-decoration:underline">https://open-auri.example/privacidade</a></p>
<p style="margin:24px 0 0;padding-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #d0d0d0;font-size:14px;color:#4a4a4a">Automated message from open-auri about an account linked to this address.<br><a href="https://open-auri.example/" style="color:#0b57d0;text-decoration:underline">open-auri</a></p>
</div>
</body>
</html>",
  "subject": "Confirm closing your open-auri account",
  "text": "Confirm account closure

Hi Ana,

We received a request to close your open-auri account. Once you confirm, the account is closed and the personal data linked to it is deleted as described in the privacy policy. This cannot be undone.

Close my account:
https://open-auri.example/conta/encerrar/confirmar?token=tok_delete

This link expires in 1 hour.

If you did not request this, ignore this message and consider changing your password. Your account stays active.

Details in the privacy policy: https://open-auri.example/privacidade

--
Automated message from open-auri about an account linked to this address.
https://open-auri.example/
",
}
`;

